{% 'Download and analyze the CSV file at s3://' & $states.input.bucket & '/' & $states.input.key & '

Use shell to download the file, then use aws_codeinterpreter_v1 to analyze it. Calculate: total revenue by region, total revenue by product, quarter-over-quarter growth rates, return rates by product, and identify top and bottom performers.

Return EXACTLY one JSON object with keys: revenue_by_region (object), revenue_by_product (object), growth_highlights (array of strings), concern_areas (array of strings), top_performer (string), bottom_performer (string). No prose, no markdown.' %}
